ore, with EBITDA margins improving to 15.6% from 14.9% YoY.\nPantaloons showed a 3% LTL growth adjusted for festive/EOSS shifts, while ethnic business expanded 20% YoY with margins at 22.7%. Losses narrowed to INR 115 crore normalized.","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f409de30-fb04-44d8-9dad-9deb9933f8a6.pdf","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-02-10T14:58:57","source":"BSE"},{"id":"478871","title":"TCNS margins rose 500 bps due to better products, retail execution.\nYTD pre-Ind AS losses dropped 50%, aiming for medium-term double-digit margins.","summary":"TCNS margins rose 500 bps due to better products, retail execution.\nYTD pre-Ind AS losses dropped 50%, aiming for medium-term double-digit margins.","url":"","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-02-09T08:53:24","source":"Livesquawk"},{"id":"478872","title":"ABFRL expects profitability from next year; TMRW targets break-even by FY29.\nGaleries Lafayette projects INR 150-200 Cr revenue with 20% profitability over time.","summary":"ABFRL expects profitability from next year; TMRW targets break-even by FY29.\nGaleries Lafayette projects INR 150-200 Cr revenue with 20% profitability over time.","url":"","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-02-09T08:53:17","source":"Livesquawk"},{"id":"478873","title":"ABFRL's Pantaloon targets mid-high single-digit L2L growth, double-digit overall growth.\nTCNS plans 50-60 new stores, targeting double-digit growth; OWNED aims for 40-50 stores by FY '29.","summary":"ABFRL's Pantaloon targets mid-high single-digit L2L growth, double-digit overall growth.\nTCNS plans 50-60 new stores, targeting double-digit growth; OWNED aims for 40-50 stores by FY '29.","url":"","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-02-09T08:53:06","source":"Livesquawk"},{"id":"474117","title":"Aditya Birla Fashion and Retail (ABFRL) approved the merger of two wholly-owned subsidiaries, Jaypore and TG Apparel & Decor.\nThe merger aims for operational simplification, cost reduction, and enhanced financial fl